1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 4=

4
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,690
I'm feeling generous.

5
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:42,800
I'm willing to give you another chance.

6
00:01:43,210 --> 00:01:45,130
You've served me well these past
few days.

7
00:01:45,570 --> 00:01:46,240
I'm quite pleased.

8
00:01:47,930 --> 00:01:49,960
Before I recover and take my leave,

9
00:01:50,770 --> 00:01:53,010
if you manage to please me,

10
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:55,080
then I'll...

11
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:01,160
I'll take you back with me.

12
00:02:02,290 --> 00:02:03,210
And I'll have you castrated.

13
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,800
You'll become

14
00:02:06,130 --> 00:02:09,130
a eunuch attending to me day and night.

15
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:16,690
I'm teasing you.

16
00:02:17,250 --> 00:02:18,200
Look how scared you are.

17
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:22,600
Right here, right now,

18
00:02:23,690 --> 00:02:24,880
I do rather like you.

19
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:28,850
You always know what to say.

20
00:02:29,130 --> 00:02:30,720
Keep me company
and chat with me tonight.

21
00:02:37,570 --> 00:02:37,970
All right.

22
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,530
That day, the county magistrate said

23
00:02:44,850 --> 00:02:46,250
your father was Yan Zhanzhi.

24
00:02:46,810 --> 00:02:47,880
Why did your whole family

25
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:49,720
move to Lingnan?

26
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:56,760
Do you remember

27
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:58,290
the Rebellion of
the Seven Military Governors?

28
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,160
Ten years ago,

29
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,760
seven military governors led
their troops into the capital.

30
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:08,530
Sheng'an was engulfed in war,
with marauding soldiers everywhere.

31
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:11,410
Father fled south with our family.

32
00:03:20,060 --> 00:03:23,540
(The Rebellion of the Seven Military
Governors, The Yan Family Flees South)

33
00:03:26,970 --> 00:03:28,579
(Xie Jinghui, Yan Shang's Mother)
(Here, have this. Eat slowly.)

34
00:03:28,621 --> 00:03:29,460
(Yan Sanlang,
Yan Shang's Younger Brother)

35
00:03:30,570 --> 00:03:31,920
(Young Yan Dalang)
(Come on, eat while it's warm.)

36
00:03:38,690 --> 00:03:39,160
(Stop!)

37
00:03:40,370 --> 00:03:40,850
(Don't run!)

38
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:44,440
(Run!)

39
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:46,920
(Run!)

40
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:09,370
My mother and younger brother

41
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:11,480
both died in that war.

42
00:04:13,090 --> 00:04:14,010
My elder brother was badly wounded

43
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,200
and was left deeply traumatized.

44
00:04:15,850 --> 00:04:16,690
My father was crippled

45
00:04:17,570 --> 00:04:18,400
and gave himself over to drink
and despair.

46
00:04:20,130 --> 00:04:20,730
From then on,

47
00:04:21,730 --> 00:04:23,010
the gifted Scholar Yan would be no more.

48
00:04:25,130 --> 00:04:27,570
They say the imperial streets
were strewn with nobles' bones.

49
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:28,490
The Yan family wasn't

50
00:04:29,170 --> 00:04:30,400
the only one wiped out.

51
00:04:32,810 --> 00:04:33,400
That's right.

52
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:36,440
It wasn't just one family

53
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,880
or one clan

54
00:04:39,810 --> 00:04:40,520
that perished in the Rebellion.

55
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:47,780
(Young Mu Wanyao)

56
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:58,570
Yan Shang.

57
00:05:01,810 --> 00:05:02,570
I'm leaving

58
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:04,930
first thing tomorrow.

59
00:05:11,930 --> 00:05:12,760
Once we part,

60
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:15,130
we'll likely never

61
00:05:15,690 --> 00:05:16,880
see each other again.

62
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:21,080
Take care, Your Highness.

63
00:05:23,250 --> 00:05:24,400
It's not even dawn yet,

64
00:05:25,370 --> 00:05:27,200
and you've already lost your resolve
to come along with me?

65
00:05:29,610 --> 00:05:30,570
I've done all I can.

66
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:31,840
I suppose

67
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:33,880
this can't be forced.

68
00:05:40,610 --> 00:05:41,640
I've always had trouble sleeping.

69
00:05:42,930 --> 00:05:43,960
Since this is our last night,

70
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,280
tell me a story.

71
00:05:48,490 --> 00:05:49,760
If it helps me sleep soundly,

72
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,880
I'll grant your request.

73
00:05:53,010 --> 00:05:53,440
How about it?

74
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,050
Go ahead.

75
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,520
Lingnan has many strange tales.

76
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:29,170
My favorite of them all

77
00:06:30,250 --> 00:06:31,280
is called Lady Jiang.

78
00:06:33,050 --> 00:06:36,810
Legend says a woman of the Jiang clan
once went into the mountains for herbs.

79
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:38,370
But then,

80
00:06:39,570 --> 00:06:40,490
she encountered a tiger.

81
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:45,170
Did it eat her?

82
00:06:46,570 --> 00:06:47,640
With the tiger's sharp claws and fangs,

83
00:06:48,170 --> 00:06:49,170
a frail woman like her

84
00:06:49,730 --> 00:06:50,730
could never fight it off.

85
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:52,050
So,

86
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:54,170
she made a dire wager

87
00:06:54,810 --> 00:06:55,810
with the tiger.

88
00:06:56,690 --> 00:06:57,280
What was the wager?

89
00:06:58,170 --> 00:06:58,640
She said,

90
00:06:59,690 --> 00:07:01,610
"Meeting you today,
I know I won't survive.

91
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:03,690
If you consume me entirely,

92
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:05,080
I'll die without complaint.

93
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:06,400
But,

94
00:07:07,050 --> 00:07:08,130
if you fail to eat me,

95
00:07:09,010 --> 00:07:11,010
even if I die
and become a vengeful spirit,

96
00:07:11,930 --> 00:07:13,130
I'll never let you go."

97
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:26,050
The tiger began to devour her.

98
00:07:27,050 --> 00:07:28,810
It had almost devoured her completely.

99
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:39,880
(The daughter of the Yaoguang Star
will bring prosperity to the dynasty.)

100
00:07:40,490 --> 00:07:42,370
(Given the Princess's auspicious name,)

101
00:07:42,610 --> 00:07:45,610
(she's the ideal bride for Meng Baiyu.)

102
00:07:47,370 --> 00:07:48,760
(Once the Princess marries,)

103
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:51,690
(North Jing will know peace.)

104
00:07:56,170 --> 00:07:57,400
The disparity in strength was immense.

105
00:07:58,320 --> 00:07:59,570
Defeat seemed inevitable.

106
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:04,610
And yet,

107
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:07,200
a piece of her little finger
fell into a crack.

108
00:08:08,170 --> 00:08:09,610
However hard the tiger clawed,

109
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:10,930
it couldn't get it out.

110
00:08:12,050 --> 00:08:12,760
At daybreak the next morning,

111
00:08:13,570 --> 00:08:14,690
the villagers were astonished

112
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:17,610
to see her dressed in crimson,
riding the tiger

113
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,080
back home.

114
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,130
She had won the wager.

115
00:08:22,690 --> 00:08:23,170
She said,

116
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:25,170
"Starting today,

117
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,440
I am the tiger's master."

118
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:36,520
That's the end.

119
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:39,450
Get some rest, my lady.

120
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:53,370
(At that moment,)

121
00:08:54,610 --> 00:08:56,920
(my heart thundered in my chest
and my blood ran hot,)

122
00:08:58,450 --> 00:08:59,520
(yet I felt no fear.)

123
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:02,680
(What I'd long kept hidden in my heart)

124
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:04,370
(had been laid bare by his words.)

125
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:06,680
(The tiger lurking in my heart)

126
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:08,610
(could no longer be restrained.)

127
00:09:10,330 --> 00:09:10,850
(That's right.)

128
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:13,490
(No more shrinking back or hesitation.)

129
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:16,450
(Moving forward is just one big gamble.)

130
00:09:17,090 --> 00:09:17,680
(If I lose,)

131
00:09:18,490 --> 00:09:19,400
(I die, that's all.)

132
00:09:20,250 --> 00:09:20,920
(If I win,)

133
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:23,130
(I become the tiger's master.)

134
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:53,760
That's a wonderful story.

135
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:55,680
It speaks right to my heart.

136
00:09:59,130 --> 00:09:59,560
Yan Shang,

137
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,090
what do you want?

138
00:10:09,250 --> 00:10:10,040
I want to go to Sheng'an

139
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:11,730
and enroll at the Imperial Academy.

140
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:13,560
All right.

141
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,010
I promise.

142
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:50,490
Shang.

143
00:10:58,850 --> 00:10:59,250
Father.

144
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:03,850
Are you leaving?

145
00:11:11,010 --> 00:11:11,640
I've failed you as a son.

146
00:11:12,370 --> 00:11:13,490
I can no longer stay to care for you.

147
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:22,250
Sheng'an is a vast place.

148
00:11:23,130 --> 00:11:24,040
Plenty of room for you
to make your mark.

149
00:11:25,610 --> 00:11:28,160
I've spent my life achieving little,
and now I'm old with nothing to show.

150
00:11:29,490 --> 00:11:30,640
If there's one thing I'm proud of,

151
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:32,490
it's you.

152
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:37,330
Go on.

153
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:44,640
♪Books bear no blade♪

154
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:50,910
♪Yet tens of thousands of scrolls
can pierce the sky♪

155
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:53,679
Sheng'an may be vast,
but it's not easy to live there.

156
00:11:53,721 --> 00:11:55,560
♪My body is the furnace,
flames reach the clouds♪

157
00:11:56,450 --> 00:11:58,560
If one day you've had enough
and grown tired of it,

158
00:11:59,010 --> 00:11:59,920
come back to Lingnan.

159
00:12:01,090 --> 00:12:02,280
Whatever fortunes life brings,

160
00:12:04,850 --> 00:12:05,640
you'll always have a home here.

161
00:12:06,690 --> 00:12:10,460
♪In all I do, I have no regrets♪

162
00:12:13,450 --> 00:12:13,970
What's wrong?

163
00:12:16,820 --> 00:12:20,120
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

164
00:12:20,970 --> 00:12:21,449
Nothing.

165
00:12:21,491 --> 00:12:26,060
♪With rain ahead, I cross the pass♪

166
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:29,690
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

167
00:12:31,060 --> 00:12:33,220
♪By noon, the mist will lift♪

168
00:12:33,450 --> 00:12:33,850
Father...

169
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:36,520
Take care.

170
00:12:40,490 --> 00:12:45,160
♪With rosy clouds,
I bid the moon goodnight♪

171
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:48,820
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

172
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:52,970
Shang,

173
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:55,970
take good care of yourself on the road.

174
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:00,130
I will.

175
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:01,400
Don't fall ill.

176
00:13:06,090 --> 00:13:06,560
Brother,

177
00:13:08,330 --> 00:13:09,090
safe travels.

178
00:13:16,850 --> 00:13:17,280
Xiaozhou,

179
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:19,520
if one day

180
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:21,250
I can return,

181
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:22,970
from then on,

182
00:13:24,210 --> 00:13:25,130
our family will stay together

183
00:13:26,250 --> 00:13:27,160
and spend the rest of our lives

184
00:13:27,970 --> 00:13:28,640
in this little thatched cottage.

185
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:33,330
If I don't return,

186
00:13:35,970 --> 00:13:36,450
you'll have to

187
00:13:37,370 --> 00:13:38,370
keep this family going.

188
00:13:39,730 --> 00:13:40,370
Our elder brother has had it hard.

189
00:13:41,450 --> 00:13:42,450
Take good care of Father.

190
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:48,210
Brother...

191
00:13:51,010 --> 00:13:52,130
Must you really go?

192
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:02,850
Brother!

193
00:14:04,210 --> 00:14:05,280
Remember to write to us.

194
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:07,160
Father and I can read your letters
to our brother.

195
00:14:08,250 --> 00:14:11,800
♪I still fear my ambitions
may go unfulfilled♪

196
00:14:16,970 --> 00:14:17,330
I will!

197
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:27,020
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

198
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:30,720
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

199
00:14:31,690 --> 00:14:36,720
♪Frost on my shoulders,
joys and sorrows stretch afar♪

200
00:14:37,090 --> 00:14:40,320
♪A thousand miles of lights
keep me company♪

201
00:14:41,660 --> 00:14:43,860
♪By noon, the mist will lift♪

202
00:14:44,060 --> 00:14:46,290
♪Rivers will bend♪

203
00:14:46,690 --> 00:14:49,820
♪Today, lean on the rail with me again♪

204
00:14:51,220 --> 00:14:56,400
♪Tread the boundless clouds
and rise with the wind♪

205
00:14:56,450 --> 00:14:59,340
♪March to the gates
with fearless hearts♪

206
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:11,680
Yan Shang,

207
00:15:12,490 --> 00:15:13,370
have you thought this through?

208
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:16,210
Sheng'an's no easy place to live.

209
00:15:17,490 --> 00:15:18,520
Across the whole Huai Dynasty,

210
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:20,970
every predator is packed into Sheng'an.

211
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:23,040
Whether it's intelligence,

212
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:24,090
scheming,

213
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:25,250
flattery,

214
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:26,560
or influence,

215
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:28,490
someone will always outdo you.

216
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:31,640
Every day, every moment,

217
00:15:32,210 --> 00:15:33,560
they're locked in fierce competition.

218
00:15:41,210 --> 00:15:41,970
Listen,

219
00:15:42,370 --> 00:15:43,920
don't think being clever

220
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:47,160
means you'll make a name for yourself
at the Imperial Academy.

221
00:15:47,490 --> 00:15:48,920
I grew up in Sheng'an.

222
00:15:49,850 --> 00:15:52,730
I've seen countless brilliant people

223
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:53,760
never get the chance they deserve

224
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:55,010
and live out ordinary lives.

225
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:00,250
Thank you for the warning.

226
00:16:01,210 --> 00:16:01,520
Your Highness,

227
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:02,970
we're ready to depart.

228
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:15,130
Shang!

229
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:28,650
What are you writing?

230
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:29,740
(Dear Brother and Sister, greetings.
Ten days on, a thousand li apart.)

231
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:30,890
A letter home.

232
00:17:31,890 --> 00:17:33,560
I'll send them all home together
once we reach Sheng'an.

233
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:36,450
"Dear Brother and Sister, greetings.

234
00:17:36,930 --> 00:17:38,080
Ten days on,

235
00:17:38,210 --> 00:17:39,800
a thousand li apart."

236
00:17:41,490 --> 00:17:41,890
How nice it must be

237
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:43,320
to get a letter like that.

238
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:46,250
I've never gotten a letter from anyone.

239
00:17:56,730 --> 00:17:57,970
We're nearly at Sheng'an.

240
00:17:59,010 --> 00:18:00,760
You'd better spend less time
on trivial matters

241
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:02,690
and more time reading poetry and prose.

242
00:18:03,210 --> 00:18:05,170
Imitate the masters
and submit your work.

243
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:07,280
That's the shortcut to success
for a scholar.

244
00:18:09,890 --> 00:18:10,360
What a shame.

245
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:11,890
I'm no good at writing poetry

246
00:18:12,520 --> 00:18:13,250
and I don't even like reading it.

247
00:18:14,890 --> 00:18:15,840
That's not good.

248
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:21,890
Fang Tong,

249
00:18:23,490 --> 00:18:24,410
where are we now?

250
00:18:25,210 --> 00:18:25,730
My lady,

251
00:18:26,170 --> 00:18:27,170
we're almost at Lantian Relay Station.

252
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:31,360
How come it's starting to rain?

253
00:18:54,010 --> 00:18:54,490
My lady,

254
00:18:55,120 --> 00:18:55,760
the rain is too heavy.

255
00:18:56,010 --> 00:18:56,840
Let's wait a while before we go on.

256
00:18:57,210 --> 00:18:58,450
There could be mudslides and rockfalls.

257
00:18:58,890 --> 00:18:59,250
All right.

258
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:05,890
Speak.

259
00:19:08,450 --> 00:19:09,320
Your wound has only just healed.

260
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:11,280
Go easy on the wine.

261
00:19:12,730 --> 00:19:13,800
You do like to meddle.

262
00:19:40,280 --> 00:19:40,930
What are you doing?

263
00:19:41,730 --> 00:19:42,040
I...

264
00:19:43,170 --> 00:19:44,120
I'm covering your ears.

265
00:19:45,890 --> 00:19:46,730
How did you know?

266
00:19:48,520 --> 00:19:49,320
That day in the cave,

267
00:19:49,840 --> 00:19:50,629
you had a terrible fever...

268
00:19:50,671 --> 00:19:51,040
Shut up!

269
00:20:11,650 --> 00:20:12,010
Your Highness,

270
00:20:12,970 --> 00:20:13,490
the rain has stopped.

271
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:29,080
What else do you know?

272
00:20:31,010 --> 00:20:31,520
Nothing else.

273
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:33,760
Tell me the truth.

274
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:37,760
If I do,

275
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:41,080
you might get angry.

276
00:20:41,520 --> 00:20:42,730
You think I'll be pleased

277
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:44,800
if you stop halfway through?

278
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:47,490
Speak!

279
00:20:50,930 --> 00:20:51,690
I also know

280
00:20:53,210 --> 00:20:54,520
that perhaps on a stormy night,

281
00:20:55,800 --> 00:20:56,730
someone tried to kill you.

282
00:20:57,730 --> 00:20:59,650
You were in grave danger,
on the brink of death,

283
00:21:01,360 --> 00:21:02,410
and it left you traumatized.

284
00:21:03,170 --> 00:21:03,800
Go on.

285
00:21:06,360 --> 00:21:07,010
Perhaps it happened

286
00:21:09,410 --> 00:21:11,080
when you were married off to North Jing.

287
00:21:14,040 --> 00:21:14,450
I'm sorry.

288
00:21:17,250 --> 00:21:17,840
Yan Shang,

289
00:21:18,690 --> 00:21:19,730
if you dare tell anyone

290
00:21:20,120 --> 00:21:21,690
what we discussed today,

291
00:21:22,410 --> 00:21:24,170
I'll rip out your tendons
and skin you alive!

292
00:21:24,730 --> 00:21:25,170
I promise.

293
00:21:25,650 --> 00:21:26,490
I won't tell a soul.

294
00:21:35,410 --> 00:21:37,280
The Sheng'an you've longed for
is right ahead.

295
00:21:38,010 --> 00:21:39,080
I'll give you this chance

296
00:21:39,760 --> 00:21:41,360
to reach it on your own.

297
00:21:42,320 --> 00:21:43,450
Fang Tong, let's go.

298
00:21:43,560 --> 00:21:43,890
Understood.

299
00:22:22,260 --> 00:22:24,020
(Sheng'an)

300
00:22:24,650 --> 00:22:26,019
(Come have a look!)

301
00:22:26,061 --> 00:22:27,930
(Hot steamed buns!)

302
00:22:28,650 --> 00:22:31,210
(Fresh out of the steamer!)

303
00:22:31,730 --> 00:22:33,810
(Come and see!)

304
00:22:34,420 --> 00:22:36,860
♪In the name her father gave♪

305
00:22:37,820 --> 00:22:43,690
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers
and slay wolves♪

306
00:22:45,660 --> 00:22:51,060
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

307
00:22:52,090 --> 00:22:58,420
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

308
00:23:00,020 --> 00:23:06,690
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

309
00:23:07,220 --> 00:23:12,860
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

310
00:23:15,020 --> 00:23:19,060
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

311
00:23:19,110 --> 00:23:22,220
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

312
00:23:22,290 --> 00:23:25,090
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers♪

313
00:23:25,490 --> 00:23:28,490
♪Bright as day for you♪

314
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:31,190
♪Though this world is hard to cross♪

315
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:32,720
♪I'll lead you through♪

316
00:23:33,030 --> 00:23:35,820
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

317
00:23:36,190 --> 00:23:40,890
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

318
00:23:49,410 --> 00:23:50,520
(If you wish to fight a tiger,)

319
00:23:51,520 --> 00:23:52,560
(you must first risk your life.)

320
00:23:54,010 --> 00:23:58,310
(This is my hunting ground.)

321
00:23:58,840 --> 00:23:59,410
(Sheng'an,)

322
00:23:59,690 --> 00:24:01,930
(I'm back.)

323
00:24:03,090 --> 00:24:05,680
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

324
00:24:22,170 --> 00:24:23,450
(I don't know when it began,)

325
00:24:23,690 --> 00:24:26,010
(but Sheng'an says you're overbearing)

326
00:24:26,280 --> 00:24:27,650
(and won't let the people eat fish.)

327
00:24:28,650 --> 00:24:31,170
(The Eastern Palace
accepting sea bass now)

328
00:24:31,840 --> 00:24:32,840
(may have an ulterior motive.)

329
00:24:35,320 --> 00:24:38,760
(Yu Cheng'an, Duke of Zhao, Cav. Gen.)
I forbid the people from eating fish?

330
00:24:39,760 --> 00:24:41,890
(Army-Inspection Commissioner)
This rumor is quite telling.

331
00:24:44,120 --> 00:24:44,970
(If that's the case,)

332
00:24:45,600 --> 00:24:46,760
(for a treacherous eunuch like me,)

333
00:24:47,170 --> 00:24:49,650
(I can least afford to
disappoint the Crown Prince.)

334
00:25:00,820 --> 00:25:06,220
(Mu Yu, Emperor)

335
00:25:14,450 --> 00:25:16,080
I heard that yesterday,

336
00:25:16,650 --> 00:25:17,600
a guest visited the Eastern Palace

337
00:25:18,040 --> 00:25:21,210
and presented Your Highness
with two sea bass.

338
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:22,520
Is that true?

339
00:25:23,280 --> 00:25:23,890
Perhaps yes.

340
00:25:25,120 --> 00:25:25,800
(Mu Xun, Crown Prince)
Perhaps not.

341
00:25:27,490 --> 00:25:28,320
I never concern myself

342
00:25:29,520 --> 00:25:30,280
with kitchen matters.

343
00:25:35,930 --> 00:25:36,960
Oh,

344
00:25:37,970 --> 00:25:38,520
Your Highness,

345
00:25:40,650 --> 00:25:42,210
you're so young

346
00:25:42,490 --> 00:25:43,760
yet your memory is already failing.

347
00:25:44,890 --> 00:25:46,040
I've heard that

348
00:25:46,520 --> 00:25:49,280
you not only accepted the fish

349
00:25:49,360 --> 00:25:50,730
and ate them after they were cooked,

350
00:25:50,840 --> 00:25:52,410
but even rewarded the man
who brought them.

351
00:25:53,800 --> 00:25:54,450
Who would've thought

352
00:25:55,320 --> 00:25:56,560
even trifles about
the Eastern Palace's meals

353
00:25:58,210 --> 00:26:00,040
would reach your ears.

354
00:26:03,320 --> 00:26:04,360
Every matter in Sheng'an,

355
00:26:05,170 --> 00:26:06,410
great or small,

356
00:26:07,450 --> 00:26:10,840
concerns the safety
of the imperial nobility.

357
00:26:11,760 --> 00:26:12,250
I am duty-bound

358
00:26:13,080 --> 00:26:14,010
to inquire.

359
00:26:17,600 --> 00:26:17,970
Your Highness,

360
00:26:20,890 --> 00:26:22,120
just tell me one thing.

361
00:26:23,080 --> 00:26:24,210
Did you receive

362
00:26:24,560 --> 00:26:25,320
those two fish

363
00:26:25,930 --> 00:26:27,040
or not?

364
00:26:38,280 --> 00:26:38,760
Xun.

365
00:26:40,250 --> 00:26:40,730
Xun.

366
00:26:44,520 --> 00:26:44,890
Your Majesty.

367
00:26:46,320 --> 00:26:47,410
Who would've thought?

368
00:26:48,450 --> 00:26:50,650
Two mere sea bass

369
00:26:51,600 --> 00:26:53,250
could make the heir to the throne

370
00:26:54,450 --> 00:26:55,280
so reluctant to answer.

371
00:26:57,930 --> 00:26:58,450
Cheng'an,

372
00:26:59,280 --> 00:27:00,890
Xun is still a child.

373
00:27:01,410 --> 00:27:02,690
Impulsive and hot-tempered,

374
00:27:03,760 --> 00:27:04,690
with a poor memory too.

375
00:27:05,360 --> 00:27:07,170
Don't hold it against him.

376
00:27:24,840 --> 00:27:26,760
Why is Your Highness sweating so much?

377
00:27:27,970 --> 00:27:28,730
Could it be

378
00:27:29,360 --> 00:27:30,730
the cold night air

379
00:27:31,730 --> 00:27:33,040
has given you a chill?

380
00:27:34,010 --> 00:27:35,320
You're in the prime of life,

381
00:27:36,210 --> 00:27:37,650
yet so frail.

382
00:27:41,520 --> 00:27:42,600
For the sake of the realm,

383
00:27:43,410 --> 00:27:45,250
you must take better care of yourself.

384
00:28:01,210 --> 00:28:01,970
Cheng'an,

385
00:28:03,360 --> 00:28:04,690
let it go.

386
00:28:05,450 --> 00:28:06,320
After all,

387
00:28:06,930 --> 00:28:09,040
you've watched him grow up.

388
00:28:12,010 --> 00:28:12,560
Xun,

389
00:28:13,210 --> 00:28:14,840
apologize to Lord Yu,

390
00:28:15,730 --> 00:28:16,730
and

391
00:28:17,760 --> 00:28:19,410
let this matter be settled.

392
00:28:23,320 --> 00:28:23,730
Xun.

393
00:28:44,040 --> 00:28:44,970
Greetings, Lord Yu.

394
00:28:45,600 --> 00:28:46,410
Greetings, Father.

395
00:28:47,690 --> 00:28:48,520
I'm back.

396
00:28:48,800 --> 00:28:49,320
Danyang, you're back.

397
00:28:53,690 --> 00:28:54,280
Rise.

398
00:28:54,730 --> 00:28:55,360
Thank you, Father.

399
00:29:00,520 --> 00:29:01,650
Brother Xun, you're here too.

400
00:29:20,800 --> 00:29:21,650
Princess Danyang.

401
00:29:23,120 --> 00:29:23,760
Is there...

402
00:29:25,600 --> 00:29:27,930
Is there something on my face?

403
00:29:31,930 --> 00:29:33,250
It's been a long time, Lord Yu.

404
00:29:34,080 --> 00:29:35,320
I've missed you.

405
00:29:36,280 --> 00:29:37,280
On this trip south,

406
00:29:37,760 --> 00:29:39,840
I picked up lots of local specialties.

407
00:29:40,890 --> 00:29:41,690
As soon as I returned,

408
00:29:41,840 --> 00:29:43,490
I sent them straight to your residence.

409
00:29:44,320 --> 00:29:45,320
But you weren't there.

410
00:29:46,010 --> 00:29:46,690
I guessed

411
00:29:46,970 --> 00:29:49,080
you must be in the palace
chatting with Father.

412
00:29:51,760 --> 00:29:52,600
It seems

413
00:29:53,170 --> 00:29:55,040
Your Highness enjoyed

414
00:29:55,410 --> 00:29:57,080
your trip very much.

415
00:29:57,800 --> 00:29:58,600
Not at all.

416
00:29:59,690 --> 00:30:00,760
This trip south

417
00:30:01,040 --> 00:30:02,690
was to pray for my mother's soul
and help her spirit find peace.

418
00:30:03,360 --> 00:30:04,930
I wouldn't dare indulge myself.

419
00:30:07,800 --> 00:30:08,280
Is that so?

420
00:30:09,360 --> 00:30:11,730
Then why have I heard

421
00:30:12,210 --> 00:30:14,080
that along the way, you...

422
00:30:15,490 --> 00:30:16,650
Lord Yu,

423
00:30:17,650 --> 00:30:18,760
please stop.

424
00:30:19,450 --> 00:30:20,930
Brother Xun is still here.

425
00:30:21,760 --> 00:30:22,760
If you say it,

426
00:30:23,280 --> 00:30:24,010
I'll never be able

427
00:30:24,730 --> 00:30:26,080
to show my face again.

428
00:30:28,320 --> 00:30:29,320
What is it?

429
00:30:29,840 --> 00:30:31,280
Now I'm quite eager to hear.

430
00:30:32,040 --> 00:30:32,600
Xun,

431
00:30:33,360 --> 00:30:34,170
you may leave.

432
00:30:35,970 --> 00:30:36,320
Yes, Father.

433
00:30:37,120 --> 00:30:39,080
Please wait, Your Highness!

434
00:30:52,560 --> 00:30:53,410
Your Highness,

435
00:30:55,080 --> 00:30:58,080
you should heed the lessons
of those before you.

436
00:31:04,080 --> 00:31:04,360
That's right.

437
00:31:05,040 --> 00:31:05,650
Xun,

438
00:31:06,120 --> 00:31:07,080
when you return,

439
00:31:07,280 --> 00:31:09,730
deal with those cooks from yesterday.

440
00:31:11,040 --> 00:31:12,040
From now on,

441
00:31:12,800 --> 00:31:14,040
be careful with all ingredients

442
00:31:14,600 --> 00:31:16,040
going in and out of the kitchen.

443
00:31:21,600 --> 00:31:22,040
Yes, Father.

444
00:31:43,360 --> 00:31:44,490
I was wrong.

445
00:31:46,930 --> 00:31:47,520
Cheng'an,

446
00:31:48,490 --> 00:31:49,760
what has she done wrong again?

447
00:31:55,560 --> 00:31:57,170
She hasn't exactly done anything wrong.

448
00:31:59,250 --> 00:32:01,210
Princess Danyang was merely

449
00:32:01,600 --> 00:32:02,690
indulging in a little youthful romance.

450
00:32:03,120 --> 00:32:04,040
It's harmless enough.

451
00:32:04,560 --> 00:32:05,280
Youthful romance?

452
00:32:09,280 --> 00:32:10,520
Father,

453
00:32:12,890 --> 00:32:14,450
I know I was wrong.

454
00:32:17,840 --> 00:32:18,250
Your Majesty,

455
00:32:19,250 --> 00:32:21,490
enjoy your reunion
with Princess Danyang.

456
00:32:21,800 --> 00:32:23,690
I'll take my leave now.

457
00:32:24,840 --> 00:32:25,970
Lord Yu, rest...

458
00:32:31,600 --> 00:32:33,040
Lord Yu, rest well.

459
00:32:33,490 --> 00:32:35,080
And take care of yourself.

460
00:32:35,730 --> 00:32:36,650
Thank you, Your Majesty!

461
00:32:45,080 --> 00:32:45,600
Father,

462
00:32:46,730 --> 00:32:47,520
the weather's turned cold

463
00:32:48,360 --> 00:32:49,840
and your old ailment
has flared up again.

464
00:32:56,210 --> 00:32:57,080
It's nothing.

465
00:33:01,010 --> 00:33:01,840
But look at you.

466
00:33:02,520 --> 00:33:03,210
You must have

467
00:33:04,250 --> 00:33:04,930
had a hard journey.

468
00:33:06,280 --> 00:33:07,490
Being out on the road

469
00:33:08,170 --> 00:33:08,800
isn't hard on me.

470
00:33:09,450 --> 00:33:10,600
But you remain in the palace,

471
00:33:11,890 --> 00:33:12,730
unable to leave.

472
00:33:13,890 --> 00:33:14,600
You're the one who's had it hard.

473
00:33:20,120 --> 00:33:22,520
Here's Princess Danyang's gift list.

474
00:33:23,490 --> 00:33:24,970
The gifts are in the reception hall.

475
00:33:25,250 --> 00:33:26,040
Would you like to look it over?

476
00:33:26,690 --> 00:33:27,120
No need.

477
00:33:27,690 --> 00:33:28,840
Handle them as you see fit.

478
00:33:29,840 --> 00:33:30,210
By the way,

479
00:33:30,730 --> 00:33:31,469
(Zheng Xing, Palace Attendant)
besides my residence,

480
00:33:31,511 --> 00:33:32,800
where else did she send gifts?

481
00:33:33,970 --> 00:33:35,490
The Liangyi Hall and the Eastern Palace.

482
00:33:36,730 --> 00:33:38,360
What did she send to the Eastern Palace?

483
00:33:39,010 --> 00:33:41,450
Female musicians bought in the south.

484
00:33:43,410 --> 00:33:44,450
Danyang...

485
00:33:45,040 --> 00:33:46,120
She really doesn't know

486
00:33:47,040 --> 00:33:48,450
how to cater to anyone's tastes.

487
00:33:59,730 --> 00:34:00,760
You're truly wise, Godfather.

488
00:34:02,890 --> 00:34:04,840
I heard the cooks at the Eastern Palace

489
00:34:05,040 --> 00:34:06,250
have all been taken care of.

490
00:34:13,600 --> 00:34:14,010
Your Highness.

491
00:34:14,930 --> 00:34:16,160
Endurance is a blade over the heart.

492
00:34:17,080 --> 00:34:18,290
I know how much you're suffering.

493
00:34:19,450 --> 00:34:20,160
But for now,

494
00:34:20,970 --> 00:34:21,770
please endure a little longer.

495
00:34:26,970 --> 00:34:28,240
One day,

496
00:34:29,720 --> 00:34:31,680
that treacherous eunuch
will surely be killed.

497
00:34:33,450 --> 00:34:34,520
And this realm

498
00:34:36,010 --> 00:34:37,560
will belong to the Mu clan in the end.

499
00:34:53,970 --> 00:34:54,410
What is it?

500
00:34:55,330 --> 00:34:56,810
(Yu Niang, Eastern Palace Adviser)
Princess Danyang has sent gifts.

501
00:34:57,160 --> 00:34:58,520
They request that
Your Highness receive them in person.

502
00:35:09,930 --> 00:35:11,160
Thank your lady for her kindness.

503
00:35:12,200 --> 00:35:13,200
Go back where you came from.

504
00:35:17,680 --> 00:35:18,600
The gesture is appreciated.

505
00:35:19,200 --> 00:35:20,520
I'll escort you ladies back.

506
00:35:39,330 --> 00:35:39,850
You?

507
00:35:41,240 --> 00:35:42,890
Will Your Highness be free tonight?

508
00:35:44,290 --> 00:35:46,770
I'd like to play a piece for you.

509
00:35:47,520 --> 00:35:48,680
Prince of Qin Breaking the Battle Array.

510
00:35:51,720 --> 00:35:52,080
All right.

511
00:36:00,600 --> 00:36:00,930
Danyang,

512
00:36:02,160 --> 00:36:02,930
did Father ask you

513
00:36:03,490 --> 00:36:04,490
to pass me a message?

514
00:36:05,120 --> 00:36:05,600
Your Highness,

515
00:36:06,560 --> 00:36:07,770
Princess Danyang

516
00:36:08,120 --> 00:36:09,290
is drinking at Cuiyun Tower tonight.

517
00:36:10,040 --> 00:36:11,120
She hasn't been to the Eastern Palace
tonight.

518
00:36:15,290 --> 00:36:16,200
What exactly is this about?

519
00:36:17,370 --> 00:36:18,080
This is no place

520
00:36:18,520 --> 00:36:19,810
for you to make trouble.

521
00:36:20,560 --> 00:36:21,010
I came

522
00:36:21,720 --> 00:36:22,640
for one reason only.

523
00:36:39,810 --> 00:36:41,410
If Your Highness wishes to achieve
this great cause,

524
00:36:42,520 --> 00:36:43,850
I am willing to be your blade.

525
00:36:51,410 --> 00:36:51,810
Danyang,

526
00:36:53,640 --> 00:36:54,200
tell me,

527
00:36:55,850 --> 00:36:57,200
is it as I suspect?

528
00:36:58,080 --> 00:36:58,640
In the past,

529
00:36:59,930 --> 00:37:01,040
I had no choice.

530
00:37:02,720 --> 00:37:03,560
But now that I've returned,

531
00:37:04,290 --> 00:37:05,490
I refuse to keep living in a daze.

532
00:37:06,930 --> 00:37:09,290
I'm willing to help you
kill that treacherous eunuch,

533
00:37:10,010 --> 00:37:11,240
reclaim power over the realm,

534
00:37:11,850 --> 00:37:13,200
and avenge the humiliation of our clan!

535
00:37:15,120 --> 00:37:15,560
Danyang,

536
00:37:17,080 --> 00:37:18,120
I underestimated

537
00:37:19,010 --> 00:37:19,810
you before.

538
00:37:20,450 --> 00:37:21,600
I realized it too late.

539
00:37:23,560 --> 00:37:24,810
You and I are both of the Mu clan.

540
00:37:25,850 --> 00:37:27,930
We share honor and shame,
life and death.

541
00:37:28,930 --> 00:37:29,410
In the past,

542
00:37:30,160 --> 00:37:31,490
I gave in to despair

543
00:37:32,520 --> 00:37:33,450
and hid away just to stay alive.

544
00:37:34,930 --> 00:37:35,810
Starting today,

545
00:37:36,810 --> 00:37:38,600
I'll do all I can to help you.

546
00:37:40,010 --> 00:37:41,200
I'm willing to do whatever it takes

547
00:37:42,080 --> 00:37:42,850
for this cause,

548
00:37:43,330 --> 00:37:44,160
fighting to the death!

549
00:38:21,100 --> 00:38:25,020
(Your Highness.)

550
00:38:28,520 --> 00:38:29,240
(By now,)

551
00:38:30,290 --> 00:38:31,370
(she must've reached Sheng'an.)

552
00:38:33,680 --> 00:38:34,770
(Heaven's favored daughter)

553
00:38:35,720 --> 00:38:36,640
(has returned home
from ten thousand li away.)

554
00:38:38,330 --> 00:38:39,770
(She must be fast asleep by now.)

555
00:38:59,890 --> 00:39:00,370
Brother,

556
00:39:01,680 --> 00:39:02,490
there's something

557
00:39:03,490 --> 00:39:04,600
I have no one else to ask.

558
00:39:06,010 --> 00:39:08,080
Less than six months
after I married into North Jing,

559
00:39:08,930 --> 00:39:10,410
I heard of Mother's death.

560
00:39:12,010 --> 00:39:13,890
But I remember
she was always in good health.

561
00:39:15,970 --> 00:39:16,520
How exactly

562
00:39:17,290 --> 00:39:18,370
did Mother die?

563
00:39:24,240 --> 00:39:25,120
It's a well-kept secret.

564
00:39:25,890 --> 00:39:26,680
Even I don't know

565
00:39:27,600 --> 00:39:28,520
the full story.

566
00:39:28,970 --> 00:39:29,680
I've only heard rumors.

567
00:39:30,560 --> 00:39:31,330
I heard

568
00:39:31,770 --> 00:39:33,160
that Father and Mother plotted

569
00:39:33,600 --> 00:39:35,160
to lure Lord Yu into the palace
and kill him.

570
00:39:35,930 --> 00:39:37,040
But the plan was exposed

571
00:39:37,560 --> 00:39:38,410
and failed at the last moment.

572
00:39:38,930 --> 00:39:39,680
That treacherous eunuch confined

573
00:39:40,410 --> 00:39:41,330
both Father and Mother.

574
00:39:43,810 --> 00:39:44,410
Mother

575
00:39:45,330 --> 00:39:46,290
had a fiery temper

576
00:39:47,330 --> 00:39:48,200
and died by cutting her own throat.

577
00:39:50,450 --> 00:39:52,600
Father fell ill with grief

578
00:39:54,010 --> 00:39:55,370
and has remained ill ever since.

579
00:39:59,560 --> 00:40:01,080
It must be the deepest wound

580
00:40:02,010 --> 00:40:03,240
of Father's life.

581
00:40:07,680 --> 00:40:08,890
I'm glad I asked you

582
00:40:09,490 --> 00:40:10,200
and not Father.

583
00:40:12,040 --> 00:40:13,490
Though I wasn't born to Mother,

584
00:40:15,160 --> 00:40:16,010
she always treated me

585
00:40:16,640 --> 00:40:17,600
as if I were her own.

586
00:40:19,240 --> 00:40:21,080
You're the only daughter Mother bore.

587
00:40:21,680 --> 00:40:22,160
Now,

588
00:40:23,080 --> 00:40:24,160
her soul rests in the underworld.

589
00:40:25,240 --> 00:40:26,240
As your elder brother,

590
00:40:27,720 --> 00:40:29,040
I should take good care of you.

591
00:40:30,490 --> 00:40:31,370
Danyang, don't worry.

592
00:40:32,080 --> 00:40:33,120
Whether we succeed or fail,

593
00:40:34,160 --> 00:40:36,120
I'll do all I can to keep you safe.

594
00:40:38,490 --> 00:40:38,930
Brother,

595
00:40:40,970 --> 00:40:41,850
if I feared death,

596
00:40:42,770 --> 00:40:43,810
would I have come to you?

597
00:40:45,640 --> 00:40:46,410
Our alliance

598
00:40:48,560 --> 00:40:49,680
matters a great deal.

599
00:40:50,330 --> 00:40:51,330
The fewer people who know,

600
00:40:52,200 --> 00:40:53,120
the safer you'll be.

601
00:40:54,520 --> 00:40:55,330
Just now,

602
00:40:55,680 --> 00:40:56,810
I thought of a solution.

603
00:40:59,640 --> 00:41:01,080
Do you remember my study companion,

604
00:41:02,200 --> 00:41:03,120
the Yang family's third son,

605
00:41:03,640 --> 00:41:04,160
Yang Si?

606
00:41:06,810 --> 00:41:08,640
You and Yang Si
were childhood sweethearts.

607
00:41:09,490 --> 00:41:10,600
Everyone in the palace saw it.

608
00:41:12,040 --> 00:41:13,240
Yang Si is my study companion.

609
00:41:14,680 --> 00:41:16,330
Being close to me is part of his duty.

610
00:41:17,810 --> 00:41:18,290
How about

611
00:41:19,240 --> 00:41:20,560
I arrange your marriage to him?

612
00:41:21,520 --> 00:41:22,370
With Yang Si by your side,

613
00:41:23,040 --> 00:41:24,040
he'll also do all he can

614
00:41:24,640 --> 00:41:25,410
to keep you safe.

615
00:41:28,640 --> 00:41:29,120
Brother,

616
00:41:30,240 --> 00:41:31,680
it's been years since I saw Yang Si.

617
00:41:33,290 --> 00:41:35,010
Our alliance concerns
our clan and the realm.

618
00:41:36,600 --> 00:41:37,970
No need to involve marriage.

619
00:41:42,890 --> 00:41:43,290
Danyang,

620
00:41:44,490 --> 00:41:45,370
I trust you, of course.

621
00:41:46,200 --> 00:41:47,450
But this would provide
another layer of cover

622
00:41:48,330 --> 00:41:49,600
and reduce the risks considerably.

623
00:41:50,770 --> 00:41:51,520
Even without this alliance

624
00:41:51,850 --> 00:41:53,010
between us,

625
00:41:54,290 --> 00:41:55,160
with Yang Si involved,

626
00:41:56,120 --> 00:41:57,720
we can still act in concert.

627
00:41:59,890 --> 00:42:00,160
All right.

628
00:42:01,160 --> 00:42:01,770
I understand.

629
00:42:04,450 --> 00:42:05,370
I'm a woman, after all.

630
00:42:06,160 --> 00:42:07,040
Let me

631
00:42:07,810 --> 00:42:08,560
think it over.

632
00:42:11,010 --> 00:42:11,370
That's fair.

633
00:42:14,200 --> 00:42:15,010
Our lives are already

634
00:42:15,850 --> 00:42:16,890
in each other's hands.

635
00:42:17,810 --> 00:42:18,240
From now on,

636
00:42:19,200 --> 00:42:20,080
there's nothing we can't discuss.

637
00:42:24,890 --> 00:42:25,640
It's late.

638
00:42:25,970 --> 00:42:27,330
I'll take my leave.

639
00:42:28,120 --> 00:42:29,490
Let's discuss this further another day.

640
00:42:48,200 --> 00:42:48,720
(Mu Xun,)

641
00:42:49,970 --> 00:42:52,010
(you're counting your chickens
far too early.)

642
00:42:55,330 --> 00:42:56,080
(Or perhaps)

643
00:42:57,560 --> 00:42:59,810
(you don't even bother
hiding your intentions from me.)

644
00:43:03,220 --> 00:43:07,660
(Next Episode Preview)

645
00:43:11,490 --> 00:43:11,850
Your Highness.

646
00:43:13,520 --> 00:43:14,010
Qilang,

647
00:43:14,080 --> 00:43:15,930
come visit my residence tonight.

648
00:43:17,080 --> 00:43:18,640
Don't you want to be my Prince Consort?

649
00:43:18,890 --> 00:43:19,850
Why do you keep avoiding me?

650
00:43:20,410 --> 00:43:22,520
Just stay the night here.

651
00:43:24,721 --> 00:43:28,014
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

652
00:43:30,699 --> 00:43:35,615
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

653
00:43:37,809 --> 00:43:43,654
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

654
00:43:44,154 --> 00:43:49,380
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

655
00:43:52,149 --> 00:43:56,940
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

656
00:43:57,776 --> 00:44:03,855
♪Through trails of mud and blood;
let grief drown in your eyes♪

657
00:44:05,656 --> 00:44:08,806
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

658
00:44:08,806 --> 00:44:10,454
♪Burning bright as a song♪

659
00:44:10,506 --> 00:44:14,230
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

660
00:44:14,608 --> 00:44:19,274
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

661
00:44:19,893 --> 00:44:23,934
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

662
00:44:24,425 --> 00:44:26,540
♪Not a single hour less♪

663
00:44:26,580 --> 00:44:33,526
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

664
00:44:34,289 --> 00:44:37,742
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

665
00:44:37,922 --> 00:44:41,067
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

666
00:44:41,506 --> 00:44:48,143
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

667
00:44:48,540 --> 00:44:53,054
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

668
00:44:53,092 --> 00:44:55,561
♪You're the only one I need♪

669
00:44:55,765 --> 00:45:02,652
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

670
00:45:02,964 --> 00:45:06,235
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

671
00:45:06,540 --> 00:45:09,713
♪My last untouched innocence♪

672
00:45:10,037 --> 00:45:13,463
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

673
00:45:13,696 --> 00:45:16,921
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

674
00:45:17,252 --> 00:45:24,048
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

675
00:45:24,417 --> 00:45:28,983
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

676
00:45:29,030 --> 00:45:31,368
♪You're the only one I need♪

677
00:45:31,599 --> 00:45:38,434
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

678
00:45:38,783 --> 00:45:40,401
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

679
00:45:40,531 --> 00:45:42,327
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

680
00:45:42,684 --> 00:45:45,701
♪You're the only one I need♪

681
00:45:45,741 --> 00:45:47,068
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

